+//   - one shared pool of persistent workers (BOPL_ENV_THREADS stepping threads
+//     in total, buffer threads included; default = CPUs in the affinity mask - 4);
+//   - per buffer a job = the envs of the current step; any thread claims envs
+//     with one fetch_add (dynamic scheduling, no straggler partition);
+//   - the buffer thread publishes its job, steps envs itself, and can step other
+//     buffers' envs while its own GPU forward runs (BOPL_ENV_STEAL=1);
+//   - claim order per step is longest-last-step first (BOPL_ENV_LPT=1): the
+//     scripted-bot envs (lookahead rollouts) are the stragglers otherwise;
+//   - BOPL_ENV_DRIVER=k (default 0) instead runs k threads that each drive
+//     several buffers' streams; measured slower, kept for A/B;
+//   - idle workers spin briefly (BOPL_ENV_SPIN_US) then park on a futex; the
+//     rollout handshake between the trainer thread and the buffer threads is a
+//     futex too (no more nanosleep polls);
+//   - BOPL_GPU_WAIT=poll replaces cudaStreamSynchronize with a cudaStreamQuery
